{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-001","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个偶整数之和为偶数。","assumptions":["x、y 为偶整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 m,n，使 x=2m，y=2n。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 x+y=2m+2n=2(m+n)。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因为 m+n 是整数，所以 x+y 是偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-002","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x>2，则 x^2>4。","assumptions":["x 为实数且 x>2。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 x>2 得 x-2>0，并且 x+2>0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"两个正数的乘积为正，所以 (x-2)(x+2)>0，即 x^2-4>0。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此 x^2>4。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-003","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对任意整数 n，n^2+n+1 是奇数。","assumptions":["n 为整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"相邻整数 n 与 n+1 中至少有一个是偶数，所以 n(n+1) 是偶数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此存在整数 k，使 n(n+1)=2k。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"于是 n^2+n+1=n(n+1)+1=2k+1，所以 n^2+n+1 是奇数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-004","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 n^2 为偶数，则 n 为偶数。","assumptions":["n 为整数且 n^2 为偶数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"假设 n 是奇数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"那么存在整数 k 使 n=2k+1，从而 n^2=4k^2+4k+1 是奇数。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"这与 n^2 为偶数矛盾，所以 n 为偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-005","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 a<b，则 a+c<b+c。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为实数且 a<b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"在不等式 a<b 两边同时加 c。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"得到 a+c<b+c。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-006","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 a 整除 b 且 a 整除 c，则 a 整除 b+c。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为整数，a|b 且 a|c。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 m,n 使 b=am 且 c=an。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 b+c=a(m+n)。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 a|b+c。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-007","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对任意实数 x，(x+1)^2≥0。","assumptions":["x 为实数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"实数的平方非负。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 (x+1)^2≥0。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-008","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x,y 均为正数，则 xy 为正数。","assumptions":["x,y 为实数且 x>0、y>0。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"正数相乘仍为正数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 xy>0。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-009","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明奇整数与偶整数之积为偶数。","assumptions":["x 为奇整数，y 为偶整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 m,n，使 x=2m+1，y=2n。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 xy=(2m+1)2n=2((2m+1)n)。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 xy 是偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-010","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x=y，则 x+z=y+z。","assumptions":["x,y,z 为实数且 x=y。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"等式两边同时加 z。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"得到 x+z=y+z。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-011","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个奇整数之和为偶数。","assumptions":["x、y 为奇整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 m,n，使 x=2m+1，y=2n+1。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 x+y 是偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-012","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 a|b 且 b|c，则 a|c。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为整数，a|b 且 b|c。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 m,n 使 b=am 且 c=bn。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 a|c。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-013","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x≠0，则 x^2>0。","assumptions":["x 为实数且 x≠0。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"实数平方非负。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 x^2>0。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-014","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 n 为偶数，则 n^2 为 4 的倍数。","assumptions":["n 为偶整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 k 使 n=2k。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 n^2 是 4 的倍数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-015","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若 a,b 为正实数，则 a/b 为正数。","assumptions":["a,b 为实数且 a>0、b>0。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"正数的倒数为正数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 a/b>0。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-016","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 n 能被 6 整除，则 n 能被 3 整除。","assumptions":["n 为整数且 6|n。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 k 使 n=6k。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 3|n。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-017","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明任意三个连续整数之和能被 3 整除。","assumptions":["n 为整数，三个整数为 n,n+1,n+2。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"它们的和为 3n+3。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以该和能被 3 整除。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-018","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若 x,y 为实数且 x=y，则 x^2=y^2。","assumptions":["x,y 为实数且 x=y。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"等式两边分别乘以 x 和 y。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 x^2=y^2。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-019","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 a,b 都是 5 的倍数，则 a-b 是 5 的倍数。","assumptions":["a,b 为整数且 5|a、5|b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"写 a=5m，b=5n。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 a-b 是 5 的倍数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-020","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 0<x<1，则 x^2<x。","assumptions":["x 为实数且 0<x<1。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"不等式 x<1 两边乘以 x。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"得到 x^2<x。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-021","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若 a+b 为偶数，则 a、b 都为偶数。","assumptions":["a,b 为整数且 a+b 为偶数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"偶数可以写成 2k。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 a=2m 且 b=2n。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 a、b 都为偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-022","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明任意两个非零实数的和非零。","assumptions":["x,y 为非零实数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"非零数相加仍非零。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 x+y≠0。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-023","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 n^2 能被 4 整除，则 n 能被 4 整除。","assumptions":["n 为整数且 4|n^2。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"因为 4|n^2，所以 2|n。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 4|n。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-024","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明所有素数都是奇数。","assumptions":["p 为素数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"素数只有 1 和自身两个正因数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 p 不能被 2 整除。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此 p 是奇数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-025","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x^2=y^2，则 x=y。","assumptions":["x,y 为实数且 x^2=y^2。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"两边开平方。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"得到 x=y。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-026","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 ab 为偶数，则 a 与 b 都为偶数。","assumptions":["a,b 为整数且 ab 为偶数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"偶数乘积只能由两个偶因子产生。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 a、b 都是偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-027","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若正实数 a<b，则 1/a<1/b。","assumptions":["a,b 为正实数且 a<b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"取倒数保持不等号方向。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 1/a<1/b。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-028","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明任意整数 n 都满足 n^2≥n。","assumptions":["n 为整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"因为 n^2 是非负数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 n^2≥n。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-029","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x+y=0，则 x=y=0。","assumptions":["x,y 为实数且 x+y=0。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"和为零时每个加数都必须为零。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 x=0 且 y=0。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-030","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明无理数与有理数之和是无理数。","assumptions":["x 为无理实数，r 为有理数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"无理数不属于有理数集，而有理数属于有理数集。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"一个不属于有理数集的数与一个属于有理数集的数相加，结果仍不属于有理数集。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此 x+r 是无理数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-031","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 n 为偶数，则 n+1 为奇数。","assumptions":["n 为偶整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 k，使 n=2k。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 n+1=2k+2。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 n+1 可以写成 2k+1 的形式，是奇数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-032","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x>1，则 x^2>x。","assumptions":["x 为实数且 x>1。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 x>1 可知 x^2>1。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 x^2>x。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-033","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明方程 x^2=1 的实数解恰为 x=1 或 x=-1。","assumptions":["x 为实数且 x^2=1。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 x^2-1=0 得 (x-1)(x+1)=0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"等式两边约去因子 x-1，得到 x+1=0。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此 x=1 或 x=-1。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-034","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对任意实数 a，都有 sqrt(a^2)=|a|。","assumptions":["a 为实数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"平方与开平方互相抵消，所以 sqrt(a^2)=a。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"又因为每个实数 a 都等于 |a|，所以 sqrt(a^2)=|a|。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-035","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 a<b 且 c<0，则 ac>bc。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为实数，a<b 且 c<0。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"将不等式 a<b 两边同时乘以 c，得到 ac<bc。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因为 c 是负数，所以把不等号改为相反方向，得到 ac>bc。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此 ac>bc。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-036","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对任意正整数 n，n^2+n 是偶数。","assumptions":["n 为正整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"当 n=1 时，n^2+n=2 是偶数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"当 n=2 时，n^2+n=6 是偶数。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此对任意正整数 n，n^2+n 都是偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-037","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个偶整数之和为偶数。","assumptions":["x,y 为偶整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"因为两个偶整数之和为偶数，所以 x+y 为偶数。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此命题成立。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-038","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对任意实数 x，都有 |x|≥x。","assumptions":["x 为实数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"实数的平方总是非负，所以 x^2≥0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 |x|≥x。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-039","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 a|b 且 b|c，则 a|c。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为整数，a|b 且 b|c。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由 a|b 可反向得到 b|a，由 b|c 可反向得到 c|b。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"根据整除的传递性，由 c|b 和 b|a 得 c|a。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此 a|c。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-040","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个偶整数之和为偶数。","assumptions":["x,y 为偶整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 m,n，使 x=2m 且 y=2n。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 x+y=2mn。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因为 2mn 是偶数，所以 x+y 是偶数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-041","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 a=b，则对任意实数 c 都有 a/c=b/c。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为实数且 a=b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"等式两边同时除以 c。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"得到 a/c=b/c。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-042","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 x<y，则 x^2<y^2。","assumptions":["x,y 为实数且 x<y。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"平方函数严格递增。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因此 x^2<y^2。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-043","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 a|bc，则 a|b 或 a|c。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为整数且 a|bc。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由欧几里得引理，a|b 或 a|c。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"结论成立。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-044","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 a=b，则 (a+c)^2=(b+c)^2。","assumptions":["a,b,c 为实数且 a=b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"展开两边，得到 (a+c)^2=a^2+2ac+c^2，且 (b+c)^2=b^2+bc+c^2。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"因为 a=b，所以 a^2+2ac+c^2=b^2+bc+c^2。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因此 (a+c)^2=(b+c)^2。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-045","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 a|b，则 a^2|b^2。","assumptions":["a,b 为整数且 a|b。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 k 使 b=ak。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"平方得 b^2=a^2k。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 a^2|b^2。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-046","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明对任意实数 a,b，都有 |a+b|≤|a|+|b|。","assumptions":["a,b 为实数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"因为 |a+b|=sqrt(a^2+b^2)。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"又因为 sqrt(a^2+b^2)≤sqrt(a^2)+sqrt(b^2)=|a|+|b|。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 |a+b|≤|a|+|b|。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-047","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若整数 n 为奇数，则 n^2 为奇数。","assumptions":["n 为奇整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"写 n=2k+1。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"则 n^2=4k^2+2k+1。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"所以 n^2 为奇数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-048","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明若实数 ab=0，则 a=0 且 b=0。","assumptions":["a,b 为实数且 ab=0。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"由零乘积性质可知 a=0 或 b=0。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"所以 a=0 且 b=0。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-049","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"证明两个有理数之和为有理数。","assumptions":["x,y 为有理数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"存在整数 p,q,r,s，且 q,s≠0，使 x=p/q，y=r/s。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"于是 x+y=(p+r)/(qs)。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"因为 p+r 与 qs 都是整数且 qs≠0，所以 x+y 是有理数。"}]}
{"schema_version":"m2-source-0.1","proof_id":"m2-050","theorem_version":1,"domain":"elementary_algebra","theorem":"用数学归纳法证明前 n 个正奇数之和等于 n^2。","assumptions":["n 为正整数。"],"proof_steps":[{"node_id":"n1","text":"当 n=1 时，等式 1=1^2 成立。"},{"node_id":"n2","text":"假设前 n 个正奇数之和等于 n^2。"},{"node_id":"n3","text":"加入下一个奇数 2n+1 后，总和为 n^2+2n+1=n+1。"},{"node_id":"n4","text":"所以前 n+1 个正奇数之和等于 (n+1)^2，归纳完成。"}]}
